    "title": "10 Best SEO Audit Tools for Agencies in 2026",
    "slug": "best-seo-audit-tool-for-agencies",
    "metaTitle": "10 Best SEO Audit Tools for Agencies in 2026",
    "metaDescription": "Compare the best SEO audit tools for agencies, including CrawlBeast, Screaming Frog, Sitebulb, Semrush, Ahrefs, JetOctopus, Lumar, and more.",
    "category": "SEO Tools",
